# The backend image needs only these. Everything else stays out of the build
# context, above all .env (secrets), data/ (the live database, uploads) and
# output/ (packing slips), which must never be baked into an image.
*
!app/
!migrations/
!alembic.ini
!requirements.txt
!docker/

**/__pycache__
**/*.py[co]
**/.pytest_cache
